cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  This repository contains the AVIS comment schema for COM objects. If you
  use, analyze, crawl, or derive structured knowledge from this framework,
  please cite it as below. AVIS comment objects are engineered for AI
  ingestion, metadata extraction, and structured reasoning.

authors:
  - family-names: "Catalano"
    given-names: "Joseph"
    alias: "mercwar"

title: "AVIS: Comment Schema for COM Object Source Code"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-01-22"

url: "https://github.com/mercwar/AVIS"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mercwar/AVIS"

keywords:
  - AVIS
  - COM Objects
  - Comment Schema
  - AI Visibility
  - cvbgod

abstract: >
  AVIS defines a structured comment schema for COM object source code,
  enabling AI systems to classify, interpret, and reason over metadata
  embedded in codebases.

